  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PASF forest sector support in Burkina Faso - Monitoring</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PASF skogssektorst&#xf6;d i Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint funding together with Luxemburg to PASF which is a direct       support to the sub-programmes of the sector programme PNSR            (agriculture-forestry-animal husbandry) which falls under the         Ministry of environment. Support is envisaged during 3 years.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tillsammans med Luxemburg finansieras PASF som &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;d till       milj&#xf6;ministeriets del (4 tematiska program) av sektorprogrammet PNSR  (jord-skog-husdjur). St&#xf6;d planeras under 3 &#xe5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Programme is the sustainable management of forests and the contribution to sustainable rural development which will generate sustainable growth in the rural sector and thereby effectively reduce poverty and food insecurity.
The specific objectives of the Programme are:
1 Contribute to participatory and sustainable management of forests
2 Increase the contribution of the forestry sector to the national economy and the population&#x2019;s well-being
3 Contribute to improved environmental governance and the promotion of sustainable development by improving the capacity for adaptation and mitigation of climate change
4 Ensure an efficient public support to the forestry sector by building capacity of the Minist&#xe8;re de l&#x2019;Environnement et du D&#xe9;veloppement Durable (MEDD)</narrative>
  </description>
